<title>UK: Thailand 1H sugar output rises year-on-year -ISO.</title>
<headline>Thailand 1H sugar output rises year-on-year -ISO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand produced 5.56 million tonnes of sugar in the first half of 1996, up from its output of 4.68 million in the same period a year ago, the International Sugar Organization (ISO) said in its latest report. Exports for the first half of this year totalled 3.93 million tonnes, mainly to the Philippines, Malaysia, Korea, Japan, Indonesia and China.</p>
<p>Thailand exported 2.88 million tonnes of sugar in the January/June 1995 period, the ISO said.</p>
